  "job_B28.1.2_20260920_210404": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00d0e lifigiende God gemyne \u00f0u Eadfri\u00f0 & E\u00f0ilwald & Billfri\u00f0 & Aldred peccator, \u00f0as feowero mi\u00f0 Gode Eadfri\u00f0 biscop Lindisfearnensis \u00e6cclesi\u00e6, he \u00f0is boc aurat \u00e6t fruma Gode & Sancte Cu\u00f0berhte & allum & e\u00f0iluald Lindisfearneolondinga biscop hit uta gi\u00f0ryde & gibelde, sva he vel cu\u00f0\u00eb. & Billfri\u00f0 se oncr\u00eb, he gismio\u00f0ade \u00f0a gihrino \u00f0a \u00f0e utan on sint, & hit gihrinade mi\u00f0 golde & mi\u00f0 & Aldred presbyter indignus & misserrimus mi\u00f0 Godes fultum\u00eb & Sancti Cu\u00f0berhtes hit ofgloesade on & Sancti Johannes d\u00e6l for hine seolfne, i.e., fore his savle, & feover ora seolfres mi\u00f0, Gode & Sancti.",
